" data-options=\"\" data-no-gap=\"\"><div class=\"san-col highlight__media highlight__media--half\" data-span=\"12 tablet-lg-6\" data-order=\"tablet-lg-2\"><div class=\"ar-tablet-lg--4by3 ar--4by3 ar\" style=\"height: 100%;\"><div class=\"highlight__single-image ar__content\">\n      <img src=\"/uploads/landscape/landscape-hond_met_tandenborstel_grijs-images-38-54.webp\" alt=\"HEALTHY FOR THE MOUTH for dogs\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"obj--cover\">\n</div>\n</div></div><div class=\"san-col pv--15 tablet-lg-pv--0\" data-span=\"12 tablet-lg-6\" data-order=\"tablet-lg-1\" data-options=\"extra-padding--tablet-lg\"><div class=\"san-container ps--0 mobile-lg-ps--15 tablet-lg-ps--0 h-100\" data-span=\"full-tablet-lg\"><div class=\"san-col tablet-lg-ps--0\"><div class=\"j-content\" data-type=\"container\" data-centered=\"\" data-block=\"\"><div class=\"j-content txt--left\" data-type=\"text\"><h2>HEALTHY FOR THE MOUTH</h2><p>Not only do we need to take care of our teeth, our four-legged friends need this too. You can brush your dog's teeth for this, but it is not always obvious. Fortunately, hard chewy snacks are great for this !&nbsp; Because chewing helps your dog against the formation of plaque and tartar. This is how your dog maintains healthy teeth. The teeth and gums are kept clean and cared for naturally.</p></div></div>\n</div></div></div></div>\n</div>\n            \n            \n            \n            \n            \n            \n                    \n\n                                        \n            \n            \n                              \n\n<div id=\"id-38-55\" class=\"highlight section section--none txt-c--nero bg-c--white title-c--chicken link-c--nero link-hc--nero\">\n    <div class=\"san-container p--0\" data-span=\"full\" data-options=\"\" data-no-gap=\"\"><div class=\"san-col highlight__media highlight__media--half\" data-span=\"12 tablet-lg-6\"><div class=\"ar-tablet-lg--4by3 ar--4by3 ar\" style=\"height: 100%;\"><div class=\"highlight__single-image ar__content\">\n      <img src=\"/uploads/landscape/landscape-shutterstock_6516627941-images-38-55.webp\" alt=\"CHEWING MAKES DOGS HAPPY!\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"obj--cover\">\n</div>\n</div></div><div class=\"san-col pv--15 tablet-lg-pv--0\" data-span=\"12 tablet-lg-6\"><div class=\"san-container ps--0 mobile-lg-ps--15 tablet-lg-ps--0 h-100\" data-span=\"full-tablet-lg\"><div class=\"san-col tablet-lg-ps--0\"><div class=\"j-content\" data-type=\"container\" data-centered=\"\" data-block=\"\"><div class=\"j-content txt--left\" data-type=\"text\"><h2>CHEWING MAKES HAPPY!</h2><p>Not only are they good for your dog's teeth, our chewy snacks have another important benefit: chewing makes your dog happy! How come ??</p><p>Well, chewing releases endorphins in the brain. Endorphins are also known as the happiness hormone. This creates a calming effect, and keeps your dog calm and composed. Dogs love to chew, as that is their natural behaviour. So it is important to give them something to chew on. This could be a toy or a snack. Chewing helps against boredom and keeps your dog occupied when owner has no time to play.</p></div></div>\n</div></div></div></div>\n</div>\n            \n            \n            \n            \n            \n            \n                    \n\n                                        \n            \n            \n                              \n\n<div id=\"id-38-56\" class=\"highlight section section--none txt-c--nero bg-c--transparent title-c--cat-primary link-c--nero link-hc--nero\">\n    <div class=\"san-container p--0\" data-span=\"full\" data-options=\"\" data-no-gap=\"\"><div class=\"san-col highlight__media highlight__media--half\" data-span=\"12 tablet-lg-6\" data-order=\"tablet-lg-2\"><div class=\"ar-tablet-lg--4by3 ar--4by3 ar\" style=\"height: 100%;\"><div class=\"highlight__single-image ar__content\">\n      <img src=\"/uploads/landscape/landscape-shutterstock_20881484921-images-38-56.webp\" alt=\"TASTY AND RESPONSIBLE CHEWING for dogs\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"obj--cover\">\n</div>\n</div></div><div class=\"san-col pv--15 tablet-lg-pv--0\" data-span=\"12 tablet-lg-6\" data-order=\"tablet-lg-1\" data-options=\"extra-padding--tablet-lg\"><div class=\"san-container ps--0 mobile-lg-ps--15 tablet-lg-ps--0 h-100\" data-span=\"full-tablet-lg\"><div class=\"san-col tablet-lg-ps--0\"><div class=\"j-content\" data-type=\"container\" data-centered=\"\" data-block=\"\"><div class=\"j-content txt--left\" data-type=\"text\"><h2>TASTY AND RESPONSIBLE CHEWING</h2><p>Voskes dried dog snacks also contribute to healthy digestion, as these naturally dried treats are easily digestible for dogs. All Voskes dried dog snacks are free of odour, colour and flavour additives and 100% natural. This makes these dog snacks also suitable for dogs with gluten or grain allergies.</p></div></div>\n</div></div></div></div>\n</div>\n            \n            \n            \n            \n            \n            \n                    \n\n                                        \n                            <div id=\"id-34-91\" class=\"section section__textblock section--none section--padding bg-c--soft-conversion txt-c--nero title-c--nero link-c--nero\">\n      <div class=\"san-container\">\n                    <div class=\"san-col\">\n        <div class=\"j-content txt--left pb--0 desktop-xl-pb--60\" data-type=\"container\">\n      <div class=\"j-content\" data-type=\"text\">\n          <h2>WHICH DRIED DOG SNACKS ARE THE BEST CHOICE FOR YOUR DOG?</h2>\n\n                </div>\n    </div>\n                </div>\n\n          </div>\n</div>\n            \n            \n            \n            \n            \n            \n            \n            \n                    \n\n                                        \n            \n            \n                              \n\n<div id=\"id-38-57\" class=\"highlight section section--none txt-c--nero bg-c--white title-c--nero link-c--nero link-hc--nero\">\n    <div class=\"san-container p--0\" data-span=\"full\" data-options=\"\" data-no-gap=\"\"><div class=\"san-col highlight__media highlight__media--half\" data-span=\"12 tablet-lg-6\" data-order=\"tablet-lg-2\"><div class=\"ar-tablet-lg--4by3 ar--4by3 ar\" style=\"height: 100%;\"><div class=\"highlight__single-image ar__content\">\n      <img src=\"/uploads/landscape/landscape-kauwsticks-images-38-57.webp\" alt=\"CHEW STICKS for dogs\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"obj--cover\">\n</div>\n</div></div><div class=\"san-col pv--15 tablet-lg-pv--0\" data-span=\"12 tablet-lg-6\" data-order=\"tablet-lg-1\" data-options=\"extra-padding--tablet-lg\"><div class=\"san-container ps--0 mobile-lg-ps--15 tablet-lg-ps--0 h-100\" data-span=\"full-tablet-lg\"><div class=\"san-col tablet-lg-ps--0\"><div class=\"j-content\" data-type=\"container\" data-centered=\"\" data-block=\"\"><div class=\"j-content txt--left\" data-type=\"text\"><h2>CHEW STICKS</h2><p>The chew sticks are delicious beef skin-based sticks enriched with an extra flavour, e.g.. Chicken, duck, beef, fish... Does your dog like to chew, but also wants to enjoy a piece of dried chicken breast or a layer of fish skin ? Then these sticks are definitely for your doggo. They are available in numerous flavours and different sizes to suit both small and large breeds.</p><a href=\"/en/dog-treats/chewing-treats?filter=chew_sticks#products-dog\" class=\"btn mt--15 btn--nero btn--normal\">Discover all chewy sticks</a></div></div>\n</div></div></div></div>\n</div>\n            \n            \n            \n            \n            \n            \n                    \n\n                                        \n            \n            \n                              \n\n<div id=\"id-38-58\" class=\"highlight section section--none txt-c--nero bg-c--transparent title-c--nero link-c--nero link-hc--nero\">\n    <div class=\"san-container p--0\" data-span=\"full\" data-options=\"\" data-no-gap=\"\"><div class=\"san-col highlight__media highlight__media--half\" data-span=\"12 tablet-lg-6\"><div class=\"ar-tablet-lg--4by3 ar--4by3 ar\" style=\"height: 100%;\"><div class=\"highlight__single-image ar__content\">\n      <img src=\"/uploads/landscape/landscape-runderhuid_snacks_21-images-38-58.webp\" alt=\"RAWHIDE SNACKS for dogs\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"obj--cover\">\n</div>\n</div></div><div class=\"san-col pv--15 tablet-lg-pv--0\" data-span=\"12 tablet-lg-6\"><div class=\"san-container ps--0 mobile-lg-ps--15 tablet-lg-ps--0 h-100\" data-span=\"full-tablet-lg\"><div class=\"san-col tablet-lg-ps--0\"><div class=\"j-content\" data-type=\"container\" data-centered=\"\" data-block=\"\"><div class=\"j-content txt--left\" data-type=\"text\"><h2>RAWHIDE SNACKS</h2><p>These treats consist of 100% dried rawhide and provide hours of chewing fun! This will really keep your four-legged friend entertained for a long time. Plenty of choice from pressed bars &amp; bones and pressed rings, knotted bones, to even chew shoes ! Moreover, these treats are available in numerous sizes and weights, so both cute Chihuahuas and tough Great Dane Dogs will find their favourite chew treat in this !</p><a href=\"/en/dog-treats/chewing-treats?filter=beef_snacks#products-dog\" class=\"btn mt--15 btn--nero btn--normal\">Our range of rawhide snacks</a></div></div>\n</div></div></div></div>\n</div>\n            \n            \n            \n            \n            \n            \n                    \n\n                                        \n            \n            \n                              \n\n<div id=\"id-38-59\" class=\"highlight section section--none txt-c--nero bg-c--white title-c--nero link-c--nero link-hc--nero\">\n    <div class=\"san-container p--0\" data-span=\"full\" data-options=\"\" data-no-gap=\"\"><div class=\"san-col highlight__media highlight__media--half\" data-span=\"12 tablet-lg-6\" data-order=\"tablet-lg-2\"><div class=\"ar-tablet-lg--4by3 ar--4by3 ar\" style=\"height: 100%;\"><div class=\"highlight__single-image ar__content\">\n      <img src=\"/uploads/landscape/landscape-natuurlijke_kauwsnacks-images-38-59.webp\" alt=\"NATURAL CHEWY SNACKS for dogs\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"obj--cover\">\n</div>\n</div></div><div class=\"san-col pv--15 tablet-lg-pv--0\" data-span=\"12 tablet-lg-6\" data-order=\"tablet-lg-1\" data-options=\"extra-padding--tablet-lg\"><div class=\"san-container ps--0 mobile-lg-ps--15 tablet-lg-ps--0 h-100\" data-span=\"full-tablet-lg\"><div class=\"san-col tablet-lg-ps--0\"><div class=\"j-content\" data-type=\"container\" data-centered=\"\" data-block=\"\"><div class=\"j-content txt--left\" data-type=\"text\"><h2>NATURAL CHEWY SNACKS</h2><p>These 100% natural chewy snacks come from different animal species, depending on your faithful companion's preference. Is your four-legged friend a fan of chicken? Can he surely choose the chicken legs, necks or wings. Or does he prefer beef ? For this, we have a wide selection of items such as beef ears, beef strips, head skin and even lung or tripe. We also have pork ears or pork ear pieces on offer. And even the fish fanatics are catered for.</p><a href=\"/en/dog-treats/chewing-treats?filter=natural_snacks#products-dog\" class=\"btn mt--15 btn--nero btn--normal\">View all products</a></div></div>\n</div></div></div></div>\n</div>\n            \n            \n            \n            \n            \n            \n            </div>"
